---
// src/components/WorkExperience.astro
---

<div class="experienceCard">
  <div class="card-header">
    <div class="role-info">
      <h3 class="role">Software Developer <span class="role-divider">|</span> Backend &amp; Data Engineering</h3>
      <span class="company">Stealth Startup</span>
    </div>

    <div class="meta-details">
      <span class="meta-item date">
        <svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"/><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="2" y2="6"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="6"/><line x1="3" x2="21" y1="10" y2="10"/>
        </svg>
        Jan 2026 – Present
      </span>
      <span class="meta-item location">
        <svg class="icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
        </svg>
        Delhi, India
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="work-stream container-tool">
    <div class="stream-heading">
      <span class="stream-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4M7 9h3M7 12h7"/><circle cx="17" cy="10" r="1"/></svg>
      </span>
      <div><span class="stream-kicker">DESKTOP APPLICATION</span><h4>Container Management Tool</h4></div>
    </div>
    <p class="stream-copy">Designed and built a desktop application in <span class="badge">Python</span> and <span class="badge">CustomTkinter</span> for managing the container lifecycle. Users can create, start, and stop <span class="badge">Docker</span> containers through a clean GUI instead of the command line.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="work-stream platform-work">
    <div class="stream-heading">
      <span class="stream-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v14c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3V5M4 12c0 1.7 3.6 3 8 3s8-1.3 8-3"/></svg>
      </span>
      <div><span class="stream-kicker">BACKEND &amp; DATA</span><h4>Core Platform</h4></div>
    </div>
    <ul class="highlights">
      <li>Developed and extended <span class="badge">RESTful APIs</span>, including request validation, serializers, and paginated responses for efficient handling of large datasets.</li>
      <li>Built data ingestion pipelines for both inserts and updates, with a focus on consistency and reliability.</li>
      <li>Contributed to the <span class="badge">NAS</span> module, improving how large files are stored and retrieved.</li>
      <li>Implemented image enhancement and alignment workflows for large-scale imagery data.</li>
      <li>Built format translators to convert data between different file and schema formats, enabling interoperability across systems.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .experienceCard {
    display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1.15rem; padding:1.4rem 1.5rem;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,255,255,.94),rgba(255,246,250,.98));
    border:1px solid #f1dce5; border-radius:15px; color:var(--text); height:100%;
    box-shadow:0 5px 18px #6c35530a; transition:transform .2s ease,border-color .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease;
  }
  .experienceCard:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); border-color:#eab7ca; box-shadow:0 10px 25px #b9577b12; }
  :global(html.dark) .experienceCard { background:linear-gradient(135deg,#302331,#352633); border-color:#50384b; }
  :global(html.dark) .experienceCard:hover { border-color:#82516b; }
  .card-header { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.8rem; }
  .role-info { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.3rem; min-width:0; }
  .role { margin:0; font-size:1.08rem; line-height:1.45; font-weight:750; color:#503b4b; letter-spacing:-.025em; }
  :global(html.dark) .role { color:#fff1f7; }
  .role-divider { color:#d69ab1; font-weight:400; padding:0 .12rem; }
  .company { color:#c6658b; font-size:.85rem; font-weight:650; }
  .meta-details { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.85rem; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .meta-item { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.35rem; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; font-size:.72rem; color:#9e8796; white-space:nowrap; }
  .icon { width:.85rem; height:.85rem; color:#ce7a9a; flex-shrink:0; }
  .work-stream { padding:1rem 1.05rem; border:1px solid #f2e2e9; border-radius:12px; background:#fffafd; }
  :global(html.dark) .work-stream { background:#2b222e; border-color:#493747; }
  .container-tool { background:linear-gradient(110deg,#fff3f7,#fffafd); border-color:#f0d4df; }
  :global(html.dark) .container-tool { background:linear-gradient(110deg,#3d2936,#2b222e); border-color:#5c3c4e; }
  .stream-heading { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:.7rem; margin-bottom:.7rem; }
  .stream-icon { display:grid; place-items:center; flex:0 0 28px; width:28px; height:28px; color:#c65f87; background:#ffeaf2; border:1px solid #f4d5e1; border-radius:10px; }
  :global(html.dark) .stream-icon { color:#ffc0d4; background:#4a2e3e; border-color:#604153; }
  .stream-icon svg { width:16px; height:16px; }
  .stream-kicker { display:block; margin-bottom:2px; color:#bf8a9f; font-size:.58rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.12em; }
  .stream-heading h4 { margin:0; color:#624a5b; font-size:.9rem; font-weight:750; }
  :global(html.dark) .stream-heading h4 { color:#ffeaf2; }
  .stream-copy { margin:0; color:#806d7b; font-size:.82rem; line-height:1.7; }
  :global(html.dark) .stream-copy,.highlights li { color:#d0bdca; }
  .highlights { margin:0; padding-left:1.15rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:.52rem; }
  .highlights li { color:#806d7b; font-size:.82rem; line-height:1.65; padding-left:.1rem; }
  .highlights li::marker { color:#da82a2; }
  .badge { display:inline-block; font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace; background:#fff0f5; color:#b4567a; border:1px solid #f2d6e1; padding:.08rem .38rem; border-radius:5px; font-size:.76rem; font-weight:650; white-space:nowrap; }
  :global(html.dark) .badge { color:#ffc2d5; background:#482b3d; border-color:#624355; }
  @media(max-width:680px) { .experienceCard{padding:1rem;gap:.9rem}.role{font-size:1rem}.meta-details{gap:.55rem}.work-stream{padding:.85rem}.highlights{gap:.6rem} }
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .experienceCard{transition:none}.experienceCard:hover{transform:none} }
</style>

